very famous law school case

00:15:04.050 --> 00:15:05.730
called the Hairy Hand case

00:15:05.730 --> 00:15:07.710
where a doctor promised a normal hand

00:15:07.710 --> 00:15:09.270
but delivered a hairy hand.

00:15:09.270 --> 00:15:11.700
And the court had to determine
the difference in value

00:15:11.700 --> 00:15:13.030
between a normal hand

00:15:13.030 --> 00:15:15.730
versus an unseemingly hairy hand.

00:15:15.730 --> 00:15:17.300
So the courts are in a position

00:15:17.300 --> 00:15:19.250
to determine what the damages are

00:15:19.250 --> 00:15:21.260
associated with being
turned into a blueberry.

00:15:21.260 --> 00:15:23.150
On the other hand Willy Wonka might argue

00:15:23.150 --> 00:15:25.040
