00:15:25.040 --> 00:15:27.980
and literally plucked the
piece of gum out of his hand

00:15:27.980 --> 00:15:30.270
against his warnings not to eat it.

00:15:30.270 --> 00:15:32.710
And that might potentially work.

00:15:32.710 --> 00:15:34.230
But the thing about products liability

00:15:34.230 --> 00:15:36.260
is it's often strict liability.

00:15:36.260 --> 00:15:38.760
Which means the courts don't
actually look at fault per say

00:15:38.760 --> 00:15:39.950
they just look to causation,

00:15:39.950 --> 00:15:42.540
did a given product cause the harm

00:15:42.540 --> 00:15:44.480
associated with someone's damages.

00:15:44.480 --> 00:15:46.170
So it's possible that comparative fault

00:15:46.170 --> 00:15:48.949
won't be an issue and Willy
Wonka will be on the hook.

